<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-[68px] md:py-[110px]">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-[10px] text-center">Manufacturing</p>
    <h1 class="text-[42px] md:text-[68px] font-bold text-ink mb-[42px] text-center">Technology &amp; Manufacturing</h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-[42px] md:gap-[68px] mb-[68px]">
        <div class="lg:w-[61.8%]">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-[10px]">Vibro Casting</p>
            <h2 class="text-[42px] font-bold text-ink mb-[26px]">Vertical Vibro Casting Process</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate leading-8 mb-[26px]">Moving away from the traditional Spun Technology, the plant is equipped with the latest concrete pipe manufacturing process &mdash; Vertical Vibro casting &mdash; with its own automated concrete batching plant. RCC vibrate casting pipes achieve great durability, smooth surfaces without cracks, and a longer service life.</p>

            <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-[10px]">Batching Plant</p>
            <h3 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-4">Concrete Batching Plant</h3>
            <p class="text-slate leading-7 mb-[26px]">Equipped with the American-made Apollo Hawk-eye Pedershaap concrete batching plant. Concrete is produced by mixing sand, water, gravel, and cement under controlled conditions following standard production procedures.</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate leading-7">
                <li><strong class="text-ink">Vibro Core Vibration:</strong> Ensures uniform compaction.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-ink">Rubber Ring Joint:</strong> Provides deviation flexibility.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:w-[38.2%] bg-white border border-line p-[26px]">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-[10px]">Quality Control</p>
            <h3 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-[26px]">Quality Assurance</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-7 mb-[26px]">Strict quality checks run from the planning stage to the delivery stage.</p>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate leading-7">
                <li><strong class="text-ink">Raw Material Examination:</strong> Cement, steel, and sand are procured from established vendors and inspected thoroughly upon arrival.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-ink">In-Process Quality Control:</strong> Manufacturing runs under the strict supervision of highly qualified staff.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-ink">Final Testing:</strong> Rigorous testing for every batch to ensure international standard compliance.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-line p-[26px] md:p-[42px]">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-[10px] text-center">Comparison</p>
        <h2 class="text-[42px] font-bold text-ink mb-[42px] text-center">Why Vertical Vibro Casting?</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-[42px] gap-y-[26px]">
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">Homogeneous compaction</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Uniform material distribution throughout the pipe wall.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">Uniform crushing strength</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Consistent strength at jacking surfaces.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">Uniform concrete at surface</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">No cosmetic cracking on the outer wall.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">No leakage</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Eliminates stony surface areas and leak paths.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">Efficient dry cast spigot</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Spigot receives efficient dry cast pressing and compaction.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">Low water-cement ratio</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Approx .25&ndash;.30 for high-strength, dense concrete.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">No slumping</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Vertical casting prevents wall slumping during cure.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">High, transparent variability</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Consistent, verifiable quality across the production run.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">High compressive strength</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Resulting from a low and constant water-cement ratio.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">Heavier walled pipe</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Increased cover and a longer design life.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">High daily capacity</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Production of large numbers of pipes possible per day.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">Excellent pipe tolerances</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Consistent tolerance control due to the automated process.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start border-t-2 border-ink pt-4">
                <span class="text-accent text-2xl mr-4">&#10003;</span>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">Any liner locking system</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-7">Compatible with all liner locking configurations.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

